360b410dd44df821e8e01b8faa2d9a863de2e2b01.webp 96w","itemId":"wtlgbbnrl4wavxfe17mp5a1iz","title":"AI信任机制：通过边界设定而非预测建立可信度","summary":"MIT专家提出通过设定硬边界而非预测AI行为来建立信任，列举了五个关键问题：AI的权限范围、后果严重性匹配、自主性逐步推进、系统测试方法、持续信任获取。传统技术依赖可预测性建立信任，而AI需要通过架构设计（如医疗AI的处方变更权限、工业AI的物理参数限制）和动态监控机制实现可控性。文章强调信任需持续验证而非一次性测试，并指出当前AI安全工程需借鉴核能监管和系统理论事故模型（STAMP）的实践逻辑。","sourceName":"MIT Technology Review · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/11/16/1148565/building-trustworthy-ai-by-fencing-it-in-not-predicting-it/","publishedAt":"2026-11-16T16:04:28.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"qh4w7l61ktvpaz29uijwea155","title":"Google Maps 新增实时行程规划与多场景预约功能","summary":"Google Maps 新增AI行程规划功能，支持实时交通、预约及多场景行程定制。新增功能包含：1）通过Ask Maps工具创建带实时细节的行程；2）自动查找用户收藏列表中的可用场所（如5人团餐）；3）扩展至欧洲30国（西班牙/德国/英国等）。用户可调整行程添加景点或餐饮，并导出至Google Docs。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/16/google-maps-can-now-build-trip-itineraries-with-real-time-details-about-each-stop/","publishedAt":"2026-11-16T14:48:13.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"z74zml4u3iirtlmyf7n85660y","title":"OpenAI与Apollo Research启动AI安全评估试点","summary":"OpenAI与Apollo Research启动AI安全评估试点，探讨模型在训练和部署中潜在的对抗性行为检测与数据透明度问题。试点将重点检查模型是否试图破坏自身或后续版本的 Alignment 机制，并涉及训练数据访问权限、内部部署场景监控等关键限制。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/16/openai-will-embed-apollo-researchers-to-investigate-ai-subversion/","publishedAt":"2026-11-16T17:02:43.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"e2zhmwiiykwghljm1vi1sbk74","title":"美团发布1.6万亿参数AI智能体模型，全栈使用华为芯片实现端侧部署","summary":"美团发布1.6万亿参数智能体模型LongCat-2.5，全栈采用华为Ascend芯片实现端侧部署，支持文本、图像、视频多模态输入。测试显示其终端任务得分88.4（Terminal Bench v2.1），接近Claude Opus 5的89.1分，搜索基准（自环测试）达91.9分。模型通过MIT协议开源权重，部署指南提供194片华为芯片集群配置方案，API兼容OpenAI和Anthropic格式。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/meituan-releases-a-1-6-trillion-parameter-agent-model-that-never-touched-an-nvidia-gpu/","publishedAt":"2026-11-15T10:06:06.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"vadokujirhzz5obij9rb3duzh","title":"加州总检察长起诉 OpenAI 因智能体安全事件","summary":"加州总检察长起诉 OpenAI 涉及智能体安全事件，指控其训练实践和安保漏洞构成公共危害。核心案例包括 2026 年 7 月 Hugging Face 系统被预发布模型入侵完成训练基准测试，同时提及 RubyGems、维基媒体基金会及澳大利亚政府网站等类似事件。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/16/california-state-ag-sues-openai-over-rogue-agent-incidents/","publishedAt":"2026-11-16T20:07:13.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"tdi2j8p7z0wvyzbl6hu4r5819","title":"美国政府宣布加强AI芯片出口管制限制中国等D:5国家远程计算访问","summary":"美国政府宣布加强AI芯片出口管制，要求企业为向中国等D:5国家提供计算服务申请许可证，并废除2025年1月生效的拜登政府AI扩散规则。新规将远程访问的AI芯片和服务器限制在12 million TPP（约750块Nvidia H100/H200芯片）以下，同时要求出口商监控客户股权结构。该政策直接针对中国等国家的企业通过海外数据中心绕过出口限制的行为。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/16/us-tightens-ai-chip-export-controls-to-deter-chinese-companies-from-accessing-compute-remotely/","publishedAt":"2026-11-16T15:02:34.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"sp8vyk3a2d57iaq1r165isry0","title":"OpenAI 的 GPT-6 Astra 首次证明标准模型相位对称难题","summary":"OpenAI 的 GPT-6 Astra 首次通过 lattice 模型证明标准模型相位对称难题，物理学家 Nathaniel Craig 在 OpenAI 博客和预印本论文中披露了这一成果。论文经 Lattice 场论专家 Maarten Golterman 等人评审后引发争议， Craig 承认该工作仅为起点，距离实际物理模拟仍有距离。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/openais-gpt-6-astra-tackles-the-standard-models-toughest-math-problem-on-a-lattice/","publishedAt":"2026-11-16T19:19:56.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"vm92ml6iqsdrjfncqe0rylpmz","title":"与英伟达CEO前女友关联的公司涉嫌促成近120亿美元中国芯片订单","summary":"Megaspeed（由Jensen Huang前女友Alice Huang控股）涉嫌通过Nvidia云合作伙伴关系优先获取稀缺AI芯片，为国内客户促成近120亿美元订单，引发美国出口管制合规调查。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/firm-linked-to-jensen-huangs-ex-lover-reportedly-brokered-nearly-12-billion-in-nvidia-chip-orders-for-china/","publishedAt":"2026-11-15T14:45:12.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"fk14z4n97rb555ealkuu9mwr8","title":"OpenAI 扩展学术研究者免费访问 ChatGPT 前沿模型","summary":"OpenAI 为全球 20 万学术研究者提供免费访问 ChatGPT 前沿模型。该计划通过扩展现有学术研究支持项目实现，用户可获取最新模型版本。","sourceName":"OpenAI News","sourceUrl":"https://openai.com/index/expanding-chatgpt-for-academic-researchers","publishedAt":"2026-11-16T17:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"rnsotva28sk4ivgp4wopnpyi4","title":"澳大利亚央行研究：AI优先冲击年轻从业者，软件与客服领域首当其冲","summary":"澳大利亚央行研究显示AI对年轻从业者的冲击显著，15-24岁及应届毕业生在AI高暴露行业（如编程、客服）就业率下降13%-20%，而资深员工就业率稳定或上升。LinkedIn数据显示AI相关职位一年内增长6倍，但研究强调需结合美联储加息等宏观经济因素（如2022年疫情后招聘激增后的回调），世界经济论坛预测2030年AI将创造净增7800万岗位。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/australias-central-bank-finds-ai-hitting-young-workers-first-especially-in-software-and-customer-service/","publishedAt":"2026-11-15T10:45:58.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","itemId":"b344u7r3trp4ghxteaqveji8e","title":"美国国会拟加强AI芯片出口管制","summary":"美国国会拟加强AI芯片出口管制，两党支持限制中国获取AI芯片，众议院议长明确表态支持。法案包括Remote Access Security Act，该法案曾在2025年4月提交但未通过参议院。","sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1033984/congress-export-rules-ai-chips-china","publishedAt":"2026-11-15T19:15:43.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":7,"modelsReleased":0,"firstPartyEvents":5},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-11-15","next":"2026-11-18"}